roller.kt (added check for cancelled orders)\n   - ApiError.kt (added error codes)\n   - OrderControllerTest.kt (added 6 new tests)\n   - ShipmentControllerTest.kt (added 1 new test)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** — Added OrderStatus enum with ACTIVE and CANCELLED; added status field to Order with default ACTIVE. Necessary because the ticket requires status reporting.\n\n2. **OrderController.kt** — Injected ShipmentRepository; added POST /{orderId}/cancel endpoint implementing the full state machine (404 if not found, idempotent if already cancelled, 409 if CONFIRMED shipment, cancel all CREATED shipments, return updated order). Necessary because this is the core requirement.\n\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** — Added findByOrderId method to find all shipments of an order. Necessary because cancel must check and cancel all shipments of the order.\n\n4. **ShipmentController.kt** — Injected OrderRepository; added check in create() to reject shipment creation for cancelled orders with 409 ORDER_CANCELLED. Necessary because the ticket requires this rejection.\n\n5. **ApiError.kt** — Added ORDER_CANNOT_CANCEL and ORDER_CANCELLED error codes. Necessary for error response differentiation.\n\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** — Added 6 new tests covering:\n   - Happy path cancel\n   - Idempotent cancel\n   - 404 for non-existent order\n   - Cancelled shipments cascade\n   - 409 with unchanged state for CONFIRMED shipment\n   - New orders default to ACTIVE\n   Necessary to verify the new endpoint behavior and ensure no regressions.\n\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 1 new test verifying 409 for shipment creation on cancelled order. Necessary to verify the cross-feature interaction.\n\n**Unresolved findings:**\n\nNone. All requirements are implemented and tested.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n**Requirement:** Add a POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint that cancels active orders, cancels their CREATED shipments atomically, allows repeated calls, rejects calls if any shipment is CONFIRMED, forbids creating new shipments for cancelled orders, and reports order status in GET responses.\n\n**Changed:**\n- Order.kt — Added OrderStatus enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED) and status field to Order data class\n- OrderController.kt — Added POST /{orderId}/cancel endpoint with full state machine (idempotent, all-or-nothing on CONFIRMED check, cascades cancel to shipments)\n- ShipmentRepository.kt — Added findByOrderId(orderId: String) to enable order-scoped shipment lookups\n- ShipmentController.kt — Added pre-check rejecting shipment creation for cancelled orders with 409 ORDER_CANCELLED\n- ApiError.kt — Added ORDER_CANNOT_CANCEL and ORDER_CANCELLED error codes\n- OrderControllerTest.kt — Added 6 tests for cancel endpoint (happy path, idempotent, 404, cascade cancellation, conflict with CONFIRMED, default ACTIVE status)\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 1 test verifying 409 on shipment creation for cancelled order\n\n**Tests:**\n- cancel_active_order: Verifies POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel returns 200 with CANCELLED status\n- cancel_already_cancelled_order: Verifies repeated cancel succeeds (idempotent)\n- cancel_nonexistent_order: Verifies 404 NOT_FOUND with ORDER_NOT_FOUND code\n- cancel_also_cancels_created_shipments: Verifies all CREATED shipments transition to CANCELLED\n- cancel_with_confirmed_shipment: Verifies 409 CONFLICT with ORDER_CANNOT_CANCEL code and no state changes\n- new_order_has_active_status: Verifies newly created orders default to ACTIVE\n- cancel_preserves_non_created_shipments: Verifies CANCELLED/non-CREATED shipments unchanged\n- create_shipment_for_cancelled_order: Verifies POST /shipments returns 409 CONFLICT with ORDER_CANCELLED code\n\n**Verification:** `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ returned BUILD SUCCESS: 21 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors. All existing tests (5 order + 5 shipment + 1 app + 3 customer) pass; new tests (6 order + 1 shipment) pass.\n\n**Not done:** Nothing. All acceptance criteria are satisfied and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3325,"cache_read_input_tokens":35451,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3325},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4eeb0473-f999-484e-af22-bd0a5440f210","uuid":"1c0c95e3-0a24-4422-8206-e903034296a4","timestamp":"2026-09-09T10:14:06.183Z","request_id":"req_011CesgteQLbRWBjt8iaVWVR"}
